    "body": "It looks like you are using a two-stage initialisation (git-bash exectutes bash). Maybe add `--noprofile` to the first level of invocation? Also the comments in your config file say not to use `--login`/`-l` on Windows, but you do. What happens with other terminals if you start `bash` as a login shell?\r\n\r\nAlso, maybe try disabling the `webGLRenderer`, to see if it fixes the problem.",
